hadiths[24]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1887","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Mujhey sakht mehnat pahunchi. To main Umar bin Khattab se mila aur un se Allah ki Kitaab ki aayat padhne ko kaha. To wo apne ghar mein daakhil huey aur use mujh par khola. To main thodi door chala aur apne chehrey key bal sakht mehnat aur bhook se gira. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) merey sar par khadey they. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Abu Hurairah! To main ne kaha: Haaazir hun Ya Rasulullah aur khushnaseeb hun! To Aap ne mera haath pakda aur mujhey khada kya aur jo mujhey tha jaan liya. To mujhey apne thikaaney ki taraf ley gaey. To merey liye doodh ka pyaala maanga. To main ne us mein se piya. Phir farmaya: Wapas aao ae Abu Hirr! To main wapas aaya aur piya. Phir farmaya: Wapas aao! To main wapas aaya aur piya yahan tak ke mera pet baraabar ho gaya. To wo pyaalay jaisa ho gaya. Unhon-ne kaha: To main Umar se mila aur unhey uska zikr kya jo merey muamley mein tha. Aur un se kaha: Allah ne wo uskey supurd kya jo tum se uska zyada haqdaar tha ae Umar! Aur Allah ki qasam main ne tum se aayat padhne ko kaha tha jabke main tum se usey zyada padhney wala hun. Umar ne kaha: Allah ki qasam mera tumhey daakhil karna mujhey us se zyada mehboob hai ke merey liye surkh oonton jaisa ho. (Bukhari: 5375)"
"1888","[AI-translation] Umar bin Abi Salma (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki parwarish mein ladka tha. Aur mera haath bartan mein ghoomta tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Ae ladkey! Allah ka naam lo! Aur apne daaen se khaao! Aur us mein se khaao jo tumharey qareeb hai! To wo mera khaana uskey baad raha. (Bukhari: 5376)"
"1889","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) faut huey jab ham donon kaalon, khajoor aur paani, se seer huey. (Bukhari: 5383)"
"1890","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne patli roti aur na bhuni hui bakri khaai yahan tak ke Allah se jaa milay. (Bukhari: 5385)"
"1891","[AI-translation] Aur Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main nahi jaanta ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kabhi chhoti pyaali par khaaya. Aur Aap key liye kabhi patli roti pakaai gai. Aur Aap ne kabhi dastarkhwaan par nahi khaaya. Qataada se kaha gaya: To wo kis par khaatey they? Unhon-ne kaha: Chataai par. (Bukhari: 5386)"
"1892","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do ka khaana teen key liye kaafi hai. Aur teen ka khaana chaar key liye kaafi hai. (Bukhari: 5392)"
"1893","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo na khaatey yahan tak ke miskeen laaya jaata jo uskey sath khaata. To main aadmi ko uskey sath khaaney key liye daakhil kya aur us ne bahut khaaya. To unhon-ne kaha: Ae Naafe! Isey merey paas daakhil na karo! Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Momin aik aañt mein khaata hai. Aur kaafir saat aañton mein khaata hai. (Bukhari: 5393)"
"1894","[AI-translation] Abu Juhaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas tha. To Aap ne uskey paas aadmi se farmaya: Main tek laga kar nahi khaata. (Bukhari: 5399)"
"1895","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khaana kabhi aib na lagaaya. Agar Aap use chaahtey to khaatey aur agar naapasand kartey to chhor detey. (Bukhari: 5409)"
"1896","[AI-translation] Sahl (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke un se kaha gaya: Kya tum ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein maida dekha? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi. To kaha gaya: Kya tum jau chhaant-tey they? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi. Lekin ham phoonktey they. (Bukhari: 5410)"
"1897","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Sahl Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai ke wo qaum key paas se guzrey jinkay saamney bhuni hui bakri thi. To unhon-ne use bulaaya. To us ne khaaney se inkaar kar diya. Aur kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) duniya se gaey aur Aap jau ki roti se seer na huey. (Bukhari: 5414)"
"1898","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik din apne sahaaba key darmiyaan khajoor taqseem ki. To har insaan ko saat khajoorein deen. To mujhey saat khajoorein deen. Un mein aik khushk thi. To un mein khajoor mujhey us se zyada pasand na thi. Us ne meri daadhein mazboot kein. (Bukhari: 5411)"
"1899","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aale Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina aamad key baad gehu key khaaney se teen raatein lagataar seer na huey yahan tak ke Aap faut ho gaey. (Bukhari: 5416)"
"1900","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) riwayat hai ke wo jab unkey ghar walon mein se mayyat marti aur uskey liye auratein jama hoten, phir unkey ghar walon aur khaason key siwa muntashir ho jaaten to wo talbeena ki handi ka hukm deten aur wo pakaai jaati. Phir sareed banaaya jaata aur talbeena us par daali jaati. Phir kehten: Us mein se khaao! Beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Talbeena beemaar key dil ko sukoon deta hai. Baaz gham ko door karta hai. (Bukhari: 5417)"
"1901","[AI-translation] Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Resham aur deebaaj na pehno! Aur sonay chaandi key bartanon mein na piyo! Aur na unki thaaliyon mein khaao! Beshak wo unkey liye duniya mein hain aur hamaarey liye aakhirat mein. (Bukhari: 5426)"
"1902","[AI-translation] Abu Masood Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ansaar mein aadmi tha jisey Abu Shuaib kaha jaata tha. Jabke uska qasaai ladka tha. To us ne kaha: Merey liye khaana banaao, main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko paanch mein paanchwaan bulaaunga. To us ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko paanch mein paanchwaan bulaaya. To aadmi unkey peechey aaya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tum ne hamein paanch mein paanchwaan bulaaya hai. Aur ye aadmi hai jo hamaarey peechey aaya hai. Phir agar chaaaho to use ijazat do aur agar chaaaho to use chhoro. Us ne kaha: Balke main ne use ijazat di. (Bukhari: 5434)"
"1903","[AI-translation] Abu Taalib key betey Jafar key betey Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko taaza khajoor kakdi key sath khaatey huey dekha. (Bukhari: 5440)"
"1904","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Madina mein Yahoodi tha. Aur wo mujhey meri khajoor mein katne tak qarz deta tha. Jabke Jaabir ki zameen thi jo Rooma key raastey mein thi. To wo baithi. To saal khaali raha. To Yahoodi katne key waqt merey paas aaya. Aur main ne us mein se kuchh nahi kaata tha. To main us se agley saal tak mohlat maangney laga aur wo inkaar karta. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko uski khabar di gai. To Aap ne apne sahaaba se farmaya: Chalo, Jaabir key liye Yahoodi se mohlat maangtey hain. To wo meri khajoor mein merey paas aey. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Yahoodi se baat karney lagey. To wo kehta: Abul Qaasim! Main use mohlat nahi deta. Phir jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dekha to Aap uthay aur khajoor mein ghoomay. Phir uskey paas aey aur us se baat ki. To us ne inkaar kar diya. To main utha aur thodi taaza khajoor laaya aur use Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key saamney rakkha. To Aap ne khaaya. Phir farmaya: Ae Jaabir tumhaara chhappar kahaan hai? To main ne Aap ko khabar di. To Aap ne farmaya: Merey liye us mein bichaao! To main ne bichaaya. To Aap daakhil huey aur soey, phir jaagey. To main Aap key paas doosri mutthi laaya. To Aap ne us mein se khaaya. Phir Aap uthay aur Yahoodi se baat ki aur us ne Aap par inkaar kar diya. To Aap khajoor mein taaza khajoor mein doosri martaba uthay. Phir farmaya: Ae Jaabir! Kaato aur adaa karo! To wo katne mein khada hua. To main ne us mein se kaata jo use adaa kya. Aur us mein se bacha. To main nikla yahan tak ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur Aap ko khushkhabri di. To Aap ne farmaya: Main gawahi deta hun ke main Allah ka Rasool hun. (Bukhari: 5443)"
"1905","[AI-translation] Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo har din subah saat ajwa khajoorein khaey to us din use zeher aur na jaadu nuqsaan dega. (Bukhari: 5445)"
"1906","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi khaey to apna haath na ponchhey yahan tak ke use chaatey ya chatwaaey. (Bukhari: 5456)"
"1907","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein they, hamaarey paas rumaalon key siwa na they magar hamari hatheliyaan aur hamari kalaaiyaan aur hamarey paon. (Bukhari: 5457)"
"1908","[AI-translation] Abu Umaama (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab apna dastarkhwaan uthaatey to farmaatey: Allah ki hamd bahut umda barkat wali, jo kaafi na ho aur na rukhsat di gai ho aur na us se be-niyaazi ho, ae hamaarey Rab! (Bukhari: 5458)"
"1909","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Umaama Raziallahu anhu se) aik riwayat mein hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab apne khaaney se faarigh hotey to farmaatey: Allah ki hamd jis ne hamein kaafi kya aur seeraab kya. Jo kaafi na ho aur na naashukri ki gai ho. (Bukhari: 5459)"
"1910","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Hijaab ko logon mein sab se zyada jaanta hun. Ubayy bin Kaab mujh se uskey baarey mein poochhtey they. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zainab bint Jahsh se dulha banay subah huey. Jabke Aap ne un se Madina mein nikaah kya tha. To Aap ne din chadhney key baad khaaney key liye logon ko bulaaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baithey aur Aap key sath aadmi baithey jab qaum uth chuki thi yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uthay. To Aap chaley aur main Aap key sath chala yahan tak ke Aap Aisha key hujrey key darwaazay tak pahunchay. Phir Aap ne gumaan kya ke wo nikley hain. To main Aap key sath wapas aaya aur wo apni jagah baithey they. To Aap wapas aey aur main Aap key sath doosri martaba wapas aaya yahan tak ke Aap Aisha key hujrey key darwaazay tak pahunchay. To Aap wapas aey aur main Aap key sath wapas aaya. Phir wo uthay they. To Aap ne merey aur apne darmiyaan parda maara aur Hijaab naazil hua. (Bukhari: 5466). Aqeeqay ki kitaab."
